---
import Button from "./ui/buttons/Button.astro";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="section-y relative z-10 bg-bg-surface text-text-primary"
  aria-label="About Straya Studio"
>
  <div class="main-container">
    <p class="sr-only">
      About Straya Studio explains the studio model, delivery standards, and global
      operating footprint including the founding base in Pakistan.
    </p>

    <!-- Section header -->
    <header class="mb-12 flex flex-col gap-6 md:mb-14 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div class="flex max-w-[42rem] flex-col gap-3">
        <p class="type-label">About the Studio</p>
        <h2 class="type-h2">Senior-led engineering, designed for direct impact.</h2>
        <p class="type-body text-text-secondary">
          Straya Studio was founded by Salman Ali as a senior-led alternative to
          traditional agency models. Based in Pakistan and serving a global market, 
          I partner with founders who need high-performance platforms engineered 
          by a specialist, not delegated to a junior team.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Button
        href="#method"
        label="See process"
        variant="ghost"
        class="group !w-fit !px-5 !py-3 !text-sm"
      >
        <svg
          class="ml-2 h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-luxury group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:group-hover:translate-x-0"
          width="16"
          height="16"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </Button>
    </header>

    <!-- About content -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-6">
      <article class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-md border border-border-default bg-bg-base p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="type-h3">How I operate</h3>
        <p class="type-body text-text-secondary">
          Every engagement is scoped, engineered, and launched by me personally. 
          By limiting the studio's capacity to 2-3 active builds, I ensure that 
          every decision, commit, and communication is handled by the same person 
          who knows your platform best.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 pt-2 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-4">
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border-default bg-bg-surface p-4">
            <p class="type-caption text-text-muted">Studio model</p>
            <p class="type-h3 mt-2">Founder-led</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border-default bg-bg-surface p-4">
            <p class="type-caption text-text-muted">Direct contact</p>
            <p class="type-h3 mt-2">Salman Ali</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-md border border-border-default bg-bg-base p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="type-h3">What clients get</h3>
        <ul class="flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0">
          <li class="type-body text-text-secondary">Direct access to the specialist building your platform.</li>
          <li class="type-body text-text-secondary">Zero delegation to account managers or junior engineers.</li>
          <li class="type-body text-text-secondary">Clean handoff with 100% ownership on your infrastructure.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
